--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Runtime dependencies
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Maven dependencies are not bundled in this repository; they are resolved at
build time and keep their own licenses. The main ones are Spring Boot
(Apache-2.0), Jakarta Faces / Mojarra (EPL-2.0 with GPL-2.0-with-classpath-
exception), PrimeFaces Community (Apache-2.0 / MIT), JoinFaces (Apache-2.0),
Flyway Community (Apache-2.0), Lombok (MIT), PostgreSQL JDBC (BSD-2-Clause),
H2 (MPL-2.0 / EPL-1.0) and cron4j (LGPL-2.1, used unmodified as a library).

Dependencies worth pointing out explicitly, because their license differs
from the usual Apache-2.0/MIT baseline. All of them are used as unmodified
libraries resolved from Maven Central and are only linked against, never
copied into or derived from this source tree:

  * it.sauronsoftware.cron4j:cron4j        LGPL-2.1

A machine-readable overview can be produced with:

    mvn license:aggregate-add-third-party
